&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Debug systematically across our codebases&lt;/strong&gt; — including repositories you&#39;re only partly familiar with, using AI tooling to get up to speed quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Write and review production code&lt;/strong&gt; — Python and SQL that avoids technical debt, plus reviewing AI-assisted code so it lands with minimal bugs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use our QA automation and cloud tooling effectively&lt;/strong&gt; — running validation properly and understanding the data science parts of our AWS pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicate with clients and colleagues&lt;/strong&gt; — explaining methodology and findings directly, with only minor assistance from senior colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
